Package: mscc-portaudio
Version: 19.8.2
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Multus SDR / MSCC Linux <local@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libpulse0
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils, pipewire-pulse | pulseaudio
Homepage: https://www.portaudio.com/
Description: PortAudio with Pulse+ALSA for MSCC (Ubuntu amd64)
 Prebuilt PortAudio 19.x shared library with PulseAudio and ALSA host
 APIs, installed under /usr/local for Multus MSCC servers.
 .
 Install this before the Ubuntu mscc_*_amd64.deb. MSCC binaries are
 linked with rpath to /usr/local so they load this library (VirtualA/B
 digi devices) instead of Debian libportaudio2.
 .
 Does not remove Debian libportaudio2.
